   3 &amp; {4\sqrt 2 } &amp; x  \cr 
   4 &amp; {5\sqrt 2 } &amp; y  \cr 
   5 &amp; k &amp; z  \cr 

 } } \right]$$ is zero, then the value of k<sup>2</sup> is :

